DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T150000
UID:6ab2d911a5dbde002aa679f8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Canada Revenue Agency (CRA) is hosting an interactive info
 rmation session to share information on recognizing various CRA-related sc
 ams.\nLearn how to spot a scam\, steps you can take to protect yourself fr
 om scams\, and what to do if you're a victim of a scam.\nDrop-in!\nInforma
 tion Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collecte
 d by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 
 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and
