DESCRIPTION:November is Financial Literacy Month.\nPresented by\nWest Neig
 hbourhood House\n\, this session will introduce the basics of Canadian per
 sonal income tax and discuss the importance of annual tax filing. Particip
 ants will also learn about the various benefits for which they may be elig
 ible.\nRegistration:\nThis virtual Zoom event is free to attend. After reg
