DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T190000
UID:6a73748dcca66c2f00a86e87@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Take a journey into the mysteries of magical illusions. Local 
 magician Ayan Deb explores the science and art of deception and illusion. 
 In this interactive workshop\, participants will enjoy and watch a series 
 of the newest tricks in the world of magic. Participants will also get a c
 hance to learn some simple\, yet astonishing magic tricks using everyday o
 bjects.\nPlease note: this is a program for\nYOUNG ADULTS (18 to 24) only.
