DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T153000
UID:6a34674d43b41b3d006f8011@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by\nWest Neighbourhood House\n\, this session will i
 ntroduce the basics of Canadian personal income tax and discuss the import
 ance of annual tax filing. Participants will also learn about the various 
 benefits for which they may be eligible.\nDrop in\, no registration requir
 ed.
