BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live in the Library: Hands off with the Theremin!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T200000
UID:6aad7ffff9ed2e003851b9aa@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get hands-off with the theremin! Join us for a free hybrid pe
 rformance and interactive workshop by Colin Boothby featuring the theremi
 n\, an electronic musical instrument played without physical contact.\nBet
