UID:6abe87d2ebad22004542492a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Resumes\, achievements and career storytelling\nLearn to descr
 ibe accomplishments\, communicate impact and tailor experience to a role. 
 Practice turning vague duties into specific examples of work completed.\nP
 articipant takeaway: A targeted professional summary and three accomplishm
 ent statements.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJoining and participating in a Z
 oom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nThis program is part of TPL's Care
 er Coaches in Residence and is generously supported by our lead donor Azri
 eli Foundation along with supporting donors Fidelity Canada\, Friends of T
