SUMMARY:Quick and Healthy Meal Prep to Simplify Your Life
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T130000
UID:6a8c46b5db86e4004d86f170@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn a new recipe and how to put together a healthy\, homemad
 e meal. Chef Carolina will provide food and nutrition insights\, and demon
 strate how anyone can effortlessly put a meal together\, how to meal plan 
 to save time and money\, and have a nutritionally balanced diet.
LOCATION:Humberwood
