DESCRIPTION:What if you could write a story where the reader chooses what 
 happens\, like a branching adventure\, a mystery\, or a game\, and have AI
  build it with you?\nIn this class\, you'll learn "vibe-coding" with our I
 nnovator-in-Residence\,\nRyan Kelln\n: using an AI coding assistant to bui
 ld your own interactive story or simple game. You'll design the branches\,
  describe the rules in plain language\, test for the tricky edge cases (wh
 at if the player picks the weird option?)\, and end up with a single file 
 you can share with anyone. Just a story you want to tell. This is the play
 ful sibling of the practical vibe-coding workshop.\nPrerequisites: Mouse\
 , keyboarding and internet skills. Computers are provided. No coding exp
 erience required. If you wish to save your work from this hands-on progra
 m\, please bring your own USB stick.\nRegistration is required and will st
