 ing for favors or trying to impress others. This interactive workshop help
 s participants reframe networking as a process of building authentic\, mut
 ually beneficial relationships. By the end of the session\, you will have 
 a clearer approach to networking and the confidence to initiate meaningful
  conversations that support your career goals.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJ
 oining and participating in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nThi
 s program is part of TPL's Career Coaches in Residence and is generously s
 upported by our lead donor Azrieli Foundation along with supporting donors
