 u're into slow burns\, second chances\, or enemies-to-lovers\, there's som
 ething here for every kind of romantic. Come read\, swoon\, and share your
  favorite moments with fellow book lovers.\nThe Romance Book for the Thurs
 day November 5 meeting is\nFossil Feud\nby Maggie North\nPlease note that 
 this book club is for individuals 18+.\nDrop in\, no registration required
