BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Before the Blue Jays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T150000
UID:6ac669e69abb62002c6cd759@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us as author\, Harvey Sahker shares about his new book\, 
 Before the Blue Jays.\nDiscover the fascinating history of professional ba
 seball in Toronto before 1977\, when the Blue Jays first took flight. Lear
 n about the major events\, venues\, and people who trailblazed the way to 
 the arrival of Major League Baseball in Toronto.\nHarvey Sahker has watche
 d baseball in a dozen countries. He has dabbled in baseball broadcasting\,
  coaching\, and umpiring. His baseball stories have adorned the pages of p
 ublications in Canada\, the USA\, Australia\, and South Africa. He plays i
 n a couple of old-timers’ baseball leagues
LOCATION:Elmbrook Park\, program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac669e69abb62002c6cd759
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
