DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T160000
UID:6ac6b918c6cddb004595f87b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for an afternoon screening of "The Devil Wears 
 Prada 2".\nThe Devil Wears Prada 2\n(2026)\nRunning time: 119 minutes\nDir
 ector: David Frankel\nStarring: Meryl Streep\, Anne Hathaway\, Emily Blunt
 \, and Stanley Tucci\nAndy Sachs returns to Runway magazine as the new fea
 tures editor where she finds her formidable former boss Miranda facing thr
 eats to her glossy print empire.\nThe North York Central Library Film Club
  meets monthly on Wednesdays. There is a short\, informal discussion after
  the screening\, time permitting.\nRegistration is not required. Please co
 ntact the Browsery Department at 416-395-5672 for more information.\nNext 
 dates: Dec 16\, Jan 20
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac6b918c6cddb004595f87b
