 rofessional goals. It covers key business branding elements and offers act
 ionable steps to enhance brand presence. Through interactive activities\, 
 participants will apply their learnings to develop both personal and busin
 ess brands\, while exploring marketing strategies and campaign elements su
 ited to their new environment.
