 cy (CRA) is hosting an information session to share information on benefit
 s and credits you may be eligible for.\nA representative from the Canada R
 evenue Agency (CRA) will provide an overview of CRA's digital services\, i
 ncluding My Account\, a secure portal that allows you to view your persona
 l income tax and benefit information and manage your tax affairs online. L
 earn how to register for and use My Account to track your refund\, view be
 nefit and credit payments\, update personal information\, set up direct de
 posit\, receive online mail\, and access a variety of CRA services.\nThe p
 resentation will also include ways to do your taxes\, free tax help\, prev
 ent scams\, and other various tools and resources CRA has available to sup
 port you.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on thi
 s form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librari
