DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T153000
UID:6aa9b8f4f9ed2e003850ec51@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Climate change is rapidly impacting natural spaces on both a l
 ocal and global scale\, including our yards. Join Toronto and Region Conse
 rvation Authority (TRCA) for an introductory gardening workshop with a foc
 us on climate change resiliency. TRCA will introduce concepts like rainwat
 er harvesting\, native plant gardening\, rain gardens\, and permeable pavi
 ng.\nReceive a free copy of the\nGreening Your Grounds Homeowner’s Guide
 \n(while supplies last) with detailed instructions on how to implement th
 ese projects at home.\nDrop in.\nNo registration required.
