 ing your immediate family here under the 'One-Year Window' program? Or\, a
 re you someone in Canada who wants to help bring refugee family or friends
  abroad to Canada under the 'Private Sponsorship of Refugees' program? In 
 collaboration with Toronto Public Library\, the Refugee Sponsorship Traini
 ng Program (RSTP) is offering you a free information session about how bot
 h programs work.\nRegistration is required.\nPlease register online via (c
 lick here:\nEventbrite\n)
