SUMMARY:Run Your One-Person Business with AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T200000
UID:6a9b51a33b6c71003e5de7bb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:When you're the whole company\, the admin never ends: emails\,
  scheduling\, proposals\, follow-ups. What if you could design a system to
  handle the busywork?\nIn this class led by our Innovator-in-Residence\,\n
 Ryan Kelln\n\, you'll learn to design an administrative system for a one-p
 erson business with AI as your assistant: intake pipelines\, email draftin
 g\, client communication\, and scheduling. Learn to map work into four pil
 es: what's rules-based\, what AI drafts\, what needs your judgment\, and w
 hat should never be automated. You'll build reusable templates and leave w
 ith a clearer plan for how AI could help your business.\nPrerequisites: M
 ouse\, keyboarding and internet skills. Computers are provided. No codin
 g experience required.\nRegistration is required and will start October 9\
 , 2026 at 12:30 PM.\nNote: Your spot will not be guaranteed after 5 minute
 s of the start of the program.\nAfter this time\, remaining seats will be 
