DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T194500
UID:6abfb67c29c3d600332d27af@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the movement\, costuming and artistry of dance throu
 gh music and choreography from well-known ballets in a demonstration by T
 eaching Artist Tanya Howard\, a former First Soloist with The National Bal
 let of Canada. In this unique experience\, participants will be invited to
  explore movement inspired by ballet and will also have the opportunity to
  discover costumes from The National Ballet of Canada and learn more about
  their role in bringing performances to life.\nBefore or after the program
  we encourage you check out\nA Legacy in Motion\n\, a collaborative exhibi
 tion between TPL’s Special Collections and The National Ballet of Canada
  Archives. Featuring original costume designs\, archival photographs\, pos
 ters and stage-worn costumes.\nPlease note that a portion of this program 
