DESCRIPTION:Create a snowy winter landscape painting in acrylics. Develop 
 an understanding of a background\, middle ground and foreground\, and lear
 n a variety of painting techniques to create depth\, distance\, and textur
 e. Apply these new skills and understanding to create a finished painting.
