DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261210T160000
UID:6ac934a929c3d600332ed700@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Elevate your holiday season by transforming ordinary gift-givi
 ng into an extraordinary artistic expression. In this engaging\, hands-on 
 workshop\, participants will learn how to design stunning\, boutique-style
  holiday packages and personalize gift toppers using paper-sculpting\, ple
 ating techniques\, and repurposed elements. Attendees will leave with two 
 fully styled holiday packages and the skills to make their presents stand 
 out under any tree.\nParticipants are welcome to bring two 6" x 8" boxes\,
  or two small items of a similar size\, to practice wrapping.\nRegistratio
 n is required.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Founder's Room on Main Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac934a929c3d600332ed700
