DESCRIPTION:Come one come all!\nParticipants will get to experience collab
 orative storytelling at its finest.\nIn this limited Campaign\, participan
 ts will be crafting the world\, their characters\, and potentially the dir
 ection of the story.\nThe campaign will begin with a session of worldbuild
 ing\, character creation\, and a democratic vote on themes and setting. Th
 is will be known as our session zero.\nFollowing sessions will see our cha
 racters progress through a 10 month campaign.(September - June) Relations
 hips will be built\, challenges conquered\, and enemies defeated!\n*Progra
 m is intended for a mature audience\, no prior experience required.\n**Reg
 istration begins Monday August 17 at 12:00pm\n***Space is limited. As a re
 sult we request customers only register for one campaign. (Either Thursday
  nights or Saturday afternoons.)\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pers
 onal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library u
 nder the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The in
 formation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery 
