 e holiday packages and personalize gift toppers using paper-sculpting\, pl
 eating techniques\,and repurposed elements. Attendees will leave with two 
 fully styled holiday packages and the skills to make their presents stand 
 out under any tree.\nParticipants are welcome to bring two 6" x 8" boxes\,
  or two small items of a similar size\, to practice wrapping.\nThis worksh
 op will be led by professional craft designer Gabriela Delworth.\nInformat
 ion Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected
